            Drag & drop <span class="text-cyber-cyan font-bold">.txt</span> or <span class="text-cyber-magenta font-bold">.log</span> files here
          </p>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-tech">or click to browse from device</p>
        </div>

        <div class="relative flex-1 min-h-[300px]">
